# File And SubFolder Enumeration Via Dir Command | T1217 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_cmd_dir_execution.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\cmd.exe" OR OriginalFileName="Cmd.Exe") (CommandLine="*-s*" OR CommandLine="*/s*" OR CommandLine="*–s*" OR CommandLine="*—s*" OR CommandLine="*―s*") CommandLine="*dir *" NOT CommandLine="*rmdir*"
